<http://digistrucmed.org/questionnaire#30100003> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/questionnaire#Answer>.
<http://digistrucmed.org/questionnaire#30100003> <http://digistrucmed.org/questionnaire#AnswerId> "30100003"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string>.
